{"id": "t097-004", "text": "Mariam and her husband are moving to Leeds early March, he got a transfer with work. She's gutted to leave the allotment, she's had it eleven years. They're renting first and then buying, probably over the summer. Her son Hugo is staying behind to finish his A levels and living with her sister Magda till June. She asked if I knew anyone up there", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transfer", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "allotment", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "A levels", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till June", "anchor": "e4"}]}
