{"id": "t097-008", "text": "So I bumped into Helen at the vet this morning and her rabbit Clover has been off his food since about Thursday. She thinks it might be his teeth again, he had the same thing last spring. They're doing bloods tomorrow morning and maybe an x-ray. Her husband's away with work so she's dealing with it all on her own. I should text her tomorrow afternoon to see what they found", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off his food", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since about Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bloods", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "x-ray", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
