{"id": "t097-028", "text": "Shira's parrot Kiwi is 20 this year apparently. Older than her niece. She talks to him in Hebrew", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot Kiwi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "20 this year", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "talks to him in Hebrew", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
