{"id": "t097-049", "text": "Kwame's brother Julien... sorry, Kwame's brother is called Kiri, not Julien. Kiri's getting married in Accra over Easter 2027. Whole family flying out for ten days, and Kwame's best man so he's writing the speech already. Alina's worried about flying that late in the pregnancy, she'll be about 7 months by then. They're going to ask the midwife at the next appointment", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Accra", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Easter 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "best man", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p6", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnancy", "owner": "p6", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p6"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "p6", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t097-050", "text": "Aoife's found a new place that takes pets so she might be able to get Bella back. Viewing sometime next week, fingers crossed", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Bella", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Viewing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t097-051", "text": "Yetunde's offer accepted. Exchange end of January, completion hopefully early March 2027. Don't forget to congratulate her properly when I see her Friday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer accepted", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Exchange", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "congratulate her properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see her Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t097-052", "text": "Claire hates surprises. Like actually hates them. Keep that in mind for anything birthday related", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates surprises", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t097-053", "text": "Ciara said Rohan's dad is home now and recovering, walking with a frame. Rohan's been staying with him most nights.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovering", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "walking with a frame", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t097-054", "text": "remind me: dentist 3 December 2026, 9.15. and post the passport renewal before then", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 December 2026, 9.15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the passport renewal", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t097-055", "text": "Lindiwe said the move went fine and she's loving having her own space. Wants a cat eventually but the lease says no", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "loving having her own space", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Wants a cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t097-056", "text": "Shira's landlord is selling, so she has to be out by end of February 2027. She's panicking a bit, rents in Manchester have gone mad and most places won't take a parrot. She's viewing two flats in Didsbury on Saturday and one in Levenshulme sometime next week. I should send her that listing I saw in Chorlton. Also ask her if Kiwi's cage fits in her mate Farid's spare room in the meantime", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "be out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking a bit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing two flats in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one in Levenshulme", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that listing I saw in Chorlton", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her if Kiwi's cage fits in her mate Farid's spare room", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the meantime", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t097-057", "text": "Chris's eldest, Aoife, wants a hamster for her 8th birthday on 9 November 2026. Chris and his wife aren't sure, but it'll probably happen", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aoife", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a hamster", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "8th birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t097-058", "text": "Helen's rabbit Clover had a tooth abscess. On antibiotics, recheck in 10 days. she's ok, just tired from all the vet trips", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tooth abscess", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recheck", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 10 days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "ok", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t097-059", "text": "Farid's moving to Lisbon for a year from March 2027 to work remotely. Paolo's going out with him for the first fortnight to help him settle in", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a year from March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "work remotely", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Paolo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out with him", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}]}
